Z||000000||KRMFiero||01-04-2001||02:32 PM||||I was closing my window today (passanger side) and it made it up about 1 inch then the side closest to the front of the car like fell down, back will still try to go up, what happined? i can pull it up but it dont stay.... I have a tarp over her now<P>Kyle<P>------------------<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2M4 SE<P>  <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/~Physcokyle/fiero.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||fiero56||01-04-2001||03:49 PM||||I don't know what happened, might be a roller fell off track or something. But if it is a manual crank window and you need a new regulator, I have a passenger side manual regulator you can have for $5+shipping that I removed from my Formula when I installed power windows.||||reg||1
